BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:DOLLHOUSE: TRANS DAY OF REMEMBERANCE BENEFIT
DTSTART:20261121T200000
DTEND:20261121T200000
UID:970178db87beabf34acba5ee4e98fc26@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:/lineup MISSMADAME FKA MS.MYLES V1NOV1NA FKA Sofia Fly Syana D
 elicious DJ NO*MAD Doll House is an event series put on by DJs and Communi
 ty Organizers Ms.Myles and Sofia Fly that aims to provide a platform where
  Trans women (the Dolls)\, and Trans people have their voices and stories 
 amplified. November 21st will be the biggest\, boldest\, and most impactfu
 l edition yet at Osler Records. November 20th is known internationally as 
 Trans Day of Remembrance and is historically and politically the most sign
 ificant of the days for the Trans community. It is a day to mourn and cele
 brate the lives of the trans people lost due to violence or suicide. It is
  a heavy day that carries a lot of emotional weight\, which is something w
 e seek to hold space for without compromising the goal of having a gatheri
 ng and celebrating our trans present and giving hope to our trans futures 
 by fundraising for recipients at GEORGE CHUVALO NEIGHBOURHOOD CENTRE &amp\
 ; RAINBOW RAILROAD. These organizations provide resources to the Trans &am
 p\; 2SLGBTQIA+ Community locally and nationally. Expect raffles\, open sta
 ge performances\, and a night filled with local DJ&#x27\;s and a special h
 ybrid set from Montreal DJ\, Artist and Organizer Syana ‍
LOCATION:2A Osler St\, 2A Osler St
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/dollhouse-trans-day-of-rememberance-benefi
 t
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
