 , work with props and lighting\, and explore composition\, model direction
  and visual storytelling through analogue photography. Bring your own anal
 ogue camera to experiment! Film rolls\, photographic equipment and essenti
 al tools will be provided. Explore set design and composition through prop
 s\, backdrops\, lighting and set installation as you develop your own phot
 ographic scene. Learn camera use\, framing\, posing and model direction wi
 th model guests joining the workshop to help you experiment with capturing
  images on film. - Hada Jazmín Navarro @hadadebarro is a transdisciplinar
 y artist born in Guanajuato and based in Mexico City. Her self-taught arti
 stic practice explores identity\, trans-feminine memory and intimacy. Sinc
