 t21.org. Her collaborations include Bad Bunny\, Lido Pimienta\, Poncili Cr
 eación and Bomba Estéreo. Her work has also been exhibited at PhotoVogue
  in Milan (2025)\, documenta fifteen in Kassel (2022) and Centro de la Ima
 gen in Mexico City (2021). - Register through the link in bio on instagram
