 onto\, ON M5S 2M7 📅 Date: November 27\, 2026 ⏰ Time: 7:00 PM – 12:0
 0 AM We are back with another salsa and bachata social! Join us for a nigh
 t full of dance\, connection\, and joy! The night will begin with beginner
 -friendly salsa and bachata classes\, followed by a social dance where you
  can enjoy the music\, practice your moves\, and dance freely. Our classes
  and space are designed with no gender roles in mind\, so feel free to lea
 d and/or follow\, switch\, and connect! 🎟 Tickets $15 (Early Bird - Cla
 ss and Social) $15 (Early Bird - Social Only\, arrive after 9pm) $20 (Gene
 ral Admission. These will be released once early bird tickets are sold - C
 lass and Social) $20 (General Admission. These will be released once early
  bird tickets are sold - Social Only\, arrive after 9pm) $25 (Support Tick
 et. Choose this ticket to help us pay our instructors and DJ - Class and S
