 9:00 pm-12:00 am- Social Dancing 🌈 Please read before purchasing your t
 icket: Baila Safica is a sapphic salsa &amp\; bachata social created to of
 fer a safe\, affirming space for sapphics to connect through dance\, music
 \, and community. This is a sapphic-centred event. If you do not identify 
 with the sapphic experience\, we kindly ask that you sit out our events. T
 his space is intentionally created to center sapphic joy\, safety\, and co
 mmunity. Sapphic identity includes lesbians\, bisexuals\, queers\, trans w
 omen\, trans men\, fems\, masc\, and non-binary folks. Our events are not 
 for cisgender men. Sapphic identity comes in different shapes and forms\; 
 we contain multitudes\, and it might look different from person to person.
  We ask everyone to be respectful of the space and each other. We are crea
 ting a safe community\, and it means everyone who comes to our events belo
 ngs here\, no matter how they present! There is no room for harassment\, b
 ullying\, prejudice\, or any type of violence! Organizers reserve the righ
 t to refuse a ticket sale to those who don&#x27\;t comply with our code of
  conduct. Organizers reserve the right to remove anyone who makes others u
 ncomfortable during the event. We want everyone in our community to be abl
 e to share the joy of dance with us. If finances are tight right now\, we 
 completely understand. Just DM us on Instagram @bailasaficatoronto. Come d
 ance\, connect\, and celebrate with us. We can’t wait to see you on the 
 dance floor 💜 ‍
