BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:CNSRED VOL.4
DTSTART:20261127T220000
DTEND:20261127T220000
UID:58802c4828caf8d2df49ab3203c83b84@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:THE LAST ONE OF THE YEAR. One more night before the year runs 
 out. CNSRED closes 2026 at Bunker with three DJs\, techno from the first t
 rack to the last\, and a dance floor with no screens on it. Friday\, Novem
 ber 27. Doors at 10 PM. We go until late. CNSRED is a Berlin-inspired unde
 rground techno event and a sanctuary for freedom\, expression\, and pure c
 onnection. Built by and for the 2SLGBTQ+ community\, this is queer energy 
 in motion where the music runs deep\, the lights stay low\, and the focus 
 is strictly on the sound. Expect hypnotic techno and dark\, driving house 
 rhythms that carry you from late night into early morning. From the openin
 g track to the final beat\, the warehouse transforms into a layered landsc
 ape of sound and movement. Every beat invites you to move differently\, ev
 ery corner offers a new sonic experience\, and the crowd is open\, express
 ive\, and alive. 🚫 No phones. 🚫 No cameras. 🚫 No distractions. Be
  present. Be immersed. What happens on the floor stays on the floor. Witho
 ut screens\, we create space for genuine connection\, shared energy\, and 
 full freedom. Your experience is yours alone — dance\, listen\, move\, r
 est\, and explore at your own pace. All queer bodies\, identities\, and ex
 pressions are welcome. No single slice of the community dominates here\; t
 his space is for all of us. Allies are welcome as guests and must honour t
 hat respect is non-negotiable. Discrimination of any kind will never be to
 lerated. Dress for power. Leather\, mesh\, boots\, sneakers\, or whatever 
 makes you feel your truest self. ‍
LOCATION:Bunker\, 489 Church St
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/cnsred-vol-4
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sugar Rush Disco VOL.1
DTSTART:20261127T220000
DTEND:20261127T220000
UID:2ffd41d948c4d4b13a42522690601b49@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:“Wear something shiny. Put your phone away.” Hello\, gorge
 ous. Fix your lipstick\, because we’re going back to the golden age of d
 isco\, when a velvet rope was the only thing standing between you and the 
 best night of your life. (Don’t worry\, you’re on the list. Everyone
 ’s on the list. We’re not monsters.) SUGAR RUSH Disco Toronto is a que
 er-forward dance experience celebrating the shimmering worlds of nu-disco 
 and old school disco\, where glittering rhythms\, deep grooves\, and pulsi
 ng basslines come together for a night built entirely around movement and 
 release. Think 1977\, but with better lighting and fewer regrets. Step int
 o a high-energy atmosphere of glowing lights\, immersive sound\, and a dan
 ce floor that never lets up. From warm\, funky disco textures to driving\,
  the music is designed to keep bodies moving and spirits lifted from the f
 irst track to the last. Our mirror ball has been working out and is ready 
 to be seen. This is more than a party. It’s a space for expression\, con
 nection\, and joy on the dance floor. Music lovers\, dancers\, and night w
 anderers come together under one roof to sweat\, sparkle\, and lose themse
 lves in the sound. Yes\, you will sweat. Yes\, it will be glamorous. Both 
 can be true. In our house we don’t judge\, we move. Proper dancing. Swea
 ty\, sparkly\, no-notes dancing. ‍
LOCATION:El Mocambo\, 464 Spadina Avenue
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/sugar-rush-disco-vol-1
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
