 ind dance skills\, she&#x27\;s bringing the heat and leaving it all on the
  floor. Dress in your favourite drag inspired outfits and get ready for a 
 unforgettable\, high-energy experience! 🌈 Food and Beverage will be ava
 ilable during your seating time. Grab your tickets and get ready for an un
 forgettable show and brunch. Tickets are limited\, so secure your spot bef
 ore it’s gone! ✨ By purchasing a ticket\, you&#x27\;ll be added to The
  Pilot’s mailing list to receive updates on upcoming events and promotio
 ns. Your contact information may also be shared with the performers so the
 y can keep you in the loop about future shows. You can unsubscribe at any 
 time. ‍
