DTSTART:20261130T180000
DTEND:20261130T180000
UID:c8f156478179c3916c6b043e5578808e@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:BIG PLANS. BIG COMMUNITY. BIG QUEER ENERGY. You’re invited t
 o the Queer Entrepreneur Network OPEN HOUSE &amp\; FUNDRAISER! What starte
 d as a desire to feel less alone in entrepreneurship has grown into a comm
 unity rooted in connection\, collaboration and reciprocity. And we’re ju
 st getting started! We’ve got BIG plans for 2027\, and we want YOU to he
 lp us build what’s next! WHAT TO EXPECT: Meet the QEN Founding Committee
  and learn about our vision for 2027 Mingle with queer entrepreneurs\, all
 ies and community supporters Enjoy a complimentary welcome drink\, snacks 
 and entertainment Enter our community raffle featuring incredible prizes f
 rom local businesses! 📅 MONDAY\, NOVEMBER 30 | 6PM 📍 Three Dollar Bi
 ll | 1592 Queen St. W. 🎟️ FREE for queer entrepreneurs | $20 for alli
 es &amp\; supporters We’re raising funds to launch our website and queer
 -owned business directory\, creating more opportunities for connection\, v
 isibility and growth. Can’t attend but want to support? We’re acceptin
 g raffle prize donations and monetary contributions! DM us to get involved
 . Community doesn’t build itself. It takes participation\, commitment an
 d people showing up for one another. That’s reciprocity in action. Queer
  entrepreneurship is worth investing in. Queer community is worth showing 
 up for. Tickets at the link in bio! Tag someone who should be in the room!
  #QueerEntrepreneurNetwork #QENToronto #QueerEntrepreneurs #SupportQueerBu
 siness #QueerCommunity ‍
LOCATION:Three Dollar Bill\, 1592 Queen Street West
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/queer-entrepreneurs-open-house-fundraiser
